eShows:\"Loading more shows...\",unableToLoadShows:\"Unable to load shows\",checkInternetConnection:\"Please check your internet connection and try again.\",noShowsAvailable:\"No shows available\",showsWillAppear:\"TV shows will appear here when available.\"},i={title:\"Ads Settings\",description:\"Support us by enabling ads. You can disable them anytime.\",enableAds:\"Enable Ads\",enableAdsDesc:\"Show ads while browsing\",backToHome:\"Back to Home\"},r={home:\"Home\",movies:\"Movies\",tvShows:\"TV Shows\",myList:\"My List\",search:\"Search\",signIn:\"Sign In\",searchAriaLabel:\"Search\",notificationsAriaLabel:\"Notifications\",watchPartiesAriaLabel:\"Watch Parties\",privacyPolicyAriaLabel:\"Privacy Policy\",settingsAriaLabel:\"Settings\",discordAriaLabel:\"Discord\",logoutAriaLabel:\"Logout\"},c={signIn:\"Sign In\",welcomeBack:\"Welcome back to Flixer\",username:\"Username\",password:\"Password\",enterUsername:\"Enter your username\",enterPassword:\"Enter your password\",signingIn:\"Signing In...\",dontHaveAccount:\"Don't have an account yet?\",createNewAccount:\"Create New Account\",createAccount:\"Create Account\",startStreaming:\"Start your streaming journey with Flixer\",chooseUsername:\"Choose a Username\",enterAUsername:\"Enter a username\",choosePassword:\"Choose a password\",confirmPassword:\"Confirm Password\",confirmYourPassword:\"Confirm your password\",passwordsDoNotMatch:\"Passwords do not match\",passwordTooShort:\"Password must be at least 8 characters long\",accountCreatedSuccess:\"Account created successfully! Please sign in.\",registrationFailed:\"Registration failed. Please try again.\",creatingAccount:\"Creating Account...\",alreadyHaveAccount:\"Already have an account?\",backToLogin:\"Back to Login\",termsPrivacy:\"By creating an account, you agree to our Terms & Privacy\",importantNote:\"Important: If you lose your login details, the admin team cannot recover your account. Please store your credentials safely.\",usernameNotFound:\"No account found with this username. Please check your username or create a new account.\",invalidPassword:\"The password you entered is incorrect. Please try again.\",unableToSignIn:\"Unable to sign in. Please try again.\"},l={play:\"Play\",continue:\"Continue\",addToMyList:\"Add to My List\",removeFromMyList:\"Remove from My List\",overview:\"Overview\",episodes:\"Episodes\",cast:\"Cast & Crew\",download:\"Download\",streaming:\"Streaming\",director:\"Director\",runtime:\"Runtime\",genres:\"Genres\",releaseDate:\"Release Date\",firstAired:\"First Aired\",seasons:\"Seasons\",episodes_count:\"Episodes\",rating:\"Rating\",notAvailable:\"Not Available\",comingSoon:\"Coming Soon\",digitalRelease:\"Digital Release\",closeDetails:\"Close details\"},d={noDescriptionAvailable:\"No description available.\",addToMyListAriaLabel:\"Add to My List\",removeFromMyListAriaLabel:\"Remove from My List\",playAriaLabel:\"Play\",moreInfoAriaLabel:\"More Info\",loading:\"Loading...\",loadingContent:\"Loading content...\",noSourcesAvailable:\"No sources available for this content. Please try again later. Check if the content is released.\",noServersFound:\"No available servers found. Please try again later. Check if the content is released.\"},u={quotes:{netflix2025:\"Welcome to 2025. Netflix still thinks gradients are innovation.\",dvdBinder:\"Streaming shouldn't feel like you're flipping through a DVD binder in your uncle's basement.\",powerpoint:\"Our homepage doesn't look like a PowerPoint from your 8th grade book report.\",houseOfCards:\"Imagine Netflix… if it didn't peak with House of Cards.\",museum:\"Our UI isn't a museum exhibit from the early 2010s.\",modernStreaming:\"Modern streaming for people who've seen a website built after jQuery.\",pixelated:\"Your eyeballs called. They're done with the pixelated Netflix genre soup.\"},play:\"Play\",addedToList:\"Added\",addToList:\"List\",details:\"Details\",series:\"SERIES\",movie:\"MOVIE\",unreleased:\"Unreleased\"},h={title:\"Watch Together\",description:\"Join public watch parties or create your own to enjoy movies and shows with others in real-time.\",signInRequired:\"Sign in to view public watch parties\",signInDescription:\"Join others watching movies and shows together\",signInButton:\"Sign In\",loadingParties:\"Loading watch parties...\",error:\"Error\",noPartiesAvailable:\"No public watch parties available\",noPartiesDescription:\"There are no public watch parties running right now.\",noPartiesHint:\"Start watching a movie or show and create your own public watch party!\",joinParty:\"Join Party\",justNow:\"Just now\",minuteAgo:\"minute ago\",minutesAgo:\"minutes ago\",hourAgo:\"hour ago\",hoursAgo:\"hours ago\",member:\"member\",members:\"members\",movie:\"Movie\",tvShow:\"TV Show\",partyHosted:\"'s Party\",season:\"Season\",episode:\"Episode\",joinToWatch:\"Join a party to watch and chat with others in real-time\",checkBackLater:\"Check back later for more watch parties\",closeAriaLabel:\"Close watch party overlay\"},g={title:\"What's New on FLIXER\",description:\"Stay up to date with the latest features, improvements, and updates.\",allCaughtUp:\"All caught up! Check back later for more updates.\",latest:\"Latest\",copy:\"Copy\",closeAriaLabel:\"Close notifications\"},m={title:\"Privacy & Data Collection\",description:\"We believe in transparency. Here's exactly what data we collect and why we're heavily anti-data collection.\",privacyPrinciplesTitle:\"Our Privacy Principles\",antiDataCollection:\"Anti-Data Collection\",antiDataCollectionDesc:\"We collect only the absolute minimum data necessary for functionality\",transparentStorage:\"Transparent Storage\",transparentStorageDesc:\"You can see and delete all your data through the settings overlay\",localFirst:\"Local First\",localFirstDesc:\"Guest users data stays on their device and is never transmitted to any servers\",whatWeCollectTitle:\"What We Collect\",withAccount:\"With Account\",withAccountDesc:\"Registered users\",withoutAccount:\"Without Account\",withoutAccountDesc:\"Guest users\",watchProgress:\"Watch Progress\",watchProgressDesc:\"Your viewing progress for movies and TV episodes\",watchProgressGuestNote:\"Stored locally only, not synced across devices\",accountInformation:\"Account Information\",accountInformationDesc:\"Username, bcrypt-hashed password (irreversible), avatar URL, and account creation date\",myListFavorites:\"My List & Favorites\",myListFavoritesDesc:\"Movies and TV shows you've added to your personal list\",watchHistory:\"Watch History\",watchHistoryDesc:\"Statistics about your viewing habits and streaks\",locationData:\"Location Data\",locationDataDesc:\"Country detection is disabled by default and must be enabled in settings. When enabled, only your country code is stored locally in cookies.\",locationDataGuestNote:\"Disabled by default - must be manually enabled in settings\",notCollected:\"Not collected\",passwordSecurityTitle:\"Password Security\",bcryptEncryption:\"Bcrypt Encryption\",bcryptEncryptionDesc:\"Military-grade password protection\",howWeProtect:\"How We Protect Your Password\",bcryptHashing:\"Bcrypt Hashing\",bcryptHashingDesc:\"Your password is hashed using bcrypt with salt rounds of 10\",uniqueSalt:\"Unique Salt\",uniqueSaltDesc:\"Each password gets a unique salt, preventing rainbow table attacks\",oneWayFunction:\"One-Way Function\",oneWayFunctionDesc:\"Bcrypt is irreversible - your original password cannot be recovered\",whatThisMeans:\"What This Means\",adminProtection:\"Admin Protection\",adminProtectionDesc:\"Even we (the owners) cannot see your actual password\",databaseSecurity:\"Database Security\",databaseSecurityDesc:\"If our database is compromised, passwords remain secure\",noRecovery:\"No Recovery\",noRecoveryDesc:\"We can only reset passwords, never retrieve them\",zeroKnowledgePassword:\"Zero-Knowledge Password Storage\",zeroKnowledgePasswordDesc:\"Your password is processed through bcrypt with 10 salt rounds, making it computationally infeasible to reverse. Even with full database access, your original password remains secure.\",privacyRecommendationsTitle:\"Our Privacy Recommendations\",protectYourself:\"Protect Yourself Online\",protectYourselfDesc:\"Essential privacy tips for 2025 and beyond\",realityCheck:\"Reality Check\",realityCheckDesc:\"This isn't just about our site. In 2025, you are tracked everywhere you go on the web. Big tech companies, advertisers, and data brokers are constantly monitoring your digital footprint. You are being watched. Here's how to fight back:\",useNoLogVPN:\"Use a No-Log VPN\",useNoLogVPNDesc:\"Hide your real IP address and location from websites, ISPs, and governments.\",vpnTips:[\"Choose providers with proven no-log policies\",\"Look for independent audits\",\"Avoid free VPNs\",\"Do research about your VPN provider before using it\"],strongPasswords:\"Strong, Unique Passwords\",strongPasswordsDesc:\"Never reuse passwords across sites. One breach shouldn't compromise everything.\",passwordTips:[\"Use a password manager\",\"Generate random 16+ character passwords\",\"Enable 2FA wherever possible\"],varyUsernames:\"Vary Your Usernames\",varyUsernamesDesc:\"Don't use the same username everywhere. Make it impossible to link accounts.\",varyUsernameTips:[\"Use different usernames per site\",\"Avoid real names or personal info\",\"Don't link to your real identity\"],useAdBlocker:\"Use an Ad Blocker\",useAdBlockerDesc:\"Block tracking scripts, ads, and malicious content before they load.\",uBlockOrigin:\"uBlock Origin (recommended)\",firefox:\"Firefox\",chrome:\"Chrome\",adBlockerTips:[\"Blocks trackers and suspicious sites\",\"Speeds up browsing significantly\"],browserPrivacy:\"Browser Privacy\",browserPrivacyDesc:\"Configure your browser to minimize tracking and data collection.\",browserPrivacyTips:[\"Disable third-party cookies\",\"Clear data regularly\"],minimizeDataSharing:\"Minimize Data Sharing\",minimizeDataSharingDesc:\"Think twice before sharing personal informa